Configuration shall reject enabled services with disabled mandatory dependencies or invalid capacities before compiling firmware.
Acceptance: Negative fixtures cover declared edges and zero/overflow capacities; supported profiles configure; errors name feature/dependency; no runtime fallback.
Verification: C# dependency-matrix configure and boundary tests.
