STATEMENT: >>>
Each firmware profile shall report linked storage, reserved stacks, pools and mailbox exclusions and fail link on region overflow.
Acceptance: Report text/rodata/data/BSS/reserves/stacks/pools without double counting; reject mailbox0x7f00 and boot reserve overlap; oversized fixture fails; networking states board RAM need.
