[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NXR-083
STATUS: PartialSourceUnverified
TITLE: Allocator audit scope
STATEMENT: >>>
Every final application ELF shall pass fail-closed known-allocator audit and independent custom pool inventory without claiming symbol absence proves leak freedom.
