Release builds shall record exact compiler, .NET, Sphinx and third-party revisions/hashes and licenses.
Acceptance: Manifest covers shipped direct/transitive dependencies and tools; missing pin/hash/license fails package; offline rebuild uses only declared inputs; updates explicit. Every enabled third-party stack/pool is covered; absent optional networking is recorded as not applicable.
