[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NXR-087
STATUS: PartialSourceUnverified
TITLE: Tracker semantic integrity
STATEMENT: >>>
The tracker shall preserve stable IDs independent of order and reject duplicates, missing dependencies, cycles, incomplete acceptance and unsupported evidence statuses.
Acceptance: Negative fixtures cover each rule; reorder preserves IDs; Planned has no implementation/test claims; source states require paths; baseline cannot assign runtime Verified.
