[REQUIREMENT]
UID: NXR-133
STATUS: Planned
TITLE: Optional simple FPGA DMA driver
STATEMENT: >>>
The BSP shall optionally support one selected FPGA DMA engine after interrupt and IPC prerequisites, with one active transfer per channel and fixed aligned buffers.
